{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9425bf0a96ce54c7","name":"Royal Fortune-Class Light Clipper","source":{"id":"source:reference-9425bf0a96ce54c7","title":"Royal Fortune-Class Light Clipper","revision":21427,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:46:55Z","sha256":"a09768b1f38287991e95f527e966e1f1ea4c497a0d9bcc408eca4dfcf9339e19","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21427","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Royal%20Fortune-Class%20Light%20Clipper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9425bf0a96ce54c7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Tof Kingdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Tof_Kingdom","referenceId":"reference:881c06ede67baf32"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Royal Fortune"]},"-Class Light Clipper is a typical ship of the line in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tof"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tof","referenceId":"reference:5c447b35b5fd50ef"}," armada. Reflecting the idiosyncrasies of its builders, the 290-meter vessel has an ornamental wake-cutting hull and energy emitters deployed in the configuration of sails. ",{"tag":"i","children":["Royal Fortune"]}," Clippers are nimble and can easily outmaneuver freighters one-fifth their size, and they move speedily through hyperspace. Each clipper has 38 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"},"- 19 each to port and starboard- plus two Quad ",{"tag":"a","children":["Batteries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Batteries"}," fore and aft. A ",{"tag":"i","children":["Royal Fortune"]}," Clipper also has one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fotia's Fire Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fotia%27s_Fire_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:9ce11d4cdb944bca"}," amidships. The vessels are crewed by a complement of 480, commanded by a Tof naval captain.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each clipper carries a minimum of 14 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," and 4 longboats; each longboat can hold 40 crew members. All members of the crew double as ground troops in the happy event of a planetary invasion.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Targeted vessels disabled by a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Royal Fortune"]}," Clipper are boarded by armed longboats protected by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," screen. Ships trying to escape from a clipper would do well to fire at its rigging, since laser strikes on its energy sails can trigger power surges that might disable onboard networks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Royal Fortune"]},"-Class Light Clipper Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 13 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/